<<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    "Then I'm leaving," you say.
    Avery catches your wrist. "We need you."
    <br><br>
    You look down at <<his>> hand, then at the doors Quinn went through. Harper waits by the open lift. "Not here," <<person3>><<he>> says.
    Avery's hand loosens. <<person1>><<He>> steps between you and the lift as you move towards the doors. "We'll discuss this later."
    <br><br>
    You cross the empty reception room and push through the doors. Behind you, the lift doors remain open. Avery has not stepped inside.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    “那我走了。”你说。
    艾弗里抓住你的手腕。“我们需要你。”
    <br><br>
    你低头看着<<his>>的手，又看看奎恩离开时经过的大门。哈珀站在敞开的电梯旁。“别在这里。”<<person3>><<he>>说。
    艾弗里的手松开了。你走向大门时，<<person1>><<he>>挡在你与电梯之间。“这件事以后再谈。”
    <br><br>
    你穿过空荡荡的招待厅，推开大门。身后的电梯门仍然开着，艾弗里还没有上楼。
<</language>><br><br>
